{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Year 5 Pass!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pass unlocks all the DLC that we will release during hexceed's fifth and final year! We will be releasing a new DLC every 2 months, each containing a new world to complete. 6 new worlds to explore! Over 700 levels to complete, and 2 brand new mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy the pass now and get each DLC as it releases! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although each DLC will be available for purchase individually, this year 5 pass will shave 16% off the total price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here is a breakdown of the DLCs included: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 - Aquilla (Mar 2025) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 -\u00a0Centaurus  (May 2025) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 - Capricornus (Jul 2025) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 - Cetus (Sep 2025) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 - Sirius (Nov 2025) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 - Alphard (Dec 2025) </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517540?t=1742587067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517540?t=1742587067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517540/2e07370d71b133fd082be821ac1cc13445a0a36e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742587067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517540/2e07370d71b133fd082be821ac1cc13445a0a36e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742587067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Year 5 Pass!</h2><p class=\"bb_p